      "writtenOn": "2020-07-06T20:02:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could rebase http://crrev/c/2098878 so that I check fingerprint GPIO here, but that doesn\u0027t buy us anything, because in cr50 we are not distinguishing fingerprint-based requests and PIN/password requests (which requires auth-time user secrets).\n\nLouis and I had discussion on whether to have flags to indicate \"fingerprint-based\" and \"PIN/password-based\" but we said no because we wanted cr50 to not know those details (which should be u2fd\u0027s job).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 388,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 388,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "49886389f8b709d9fab1aa9a7ec5a43f50fbe664",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
